SARWAR KA BADAN CHHALNI CHHALNI SAR PEET KE QAHAR RONE LAGI<br>
 BEKAS THI BAHEN LAASHE PE KHADI YE DEKH KE MANZAR RONE LAGI<br>
<br>
QASIM KI NIRALI SHAADI HAI DONO KI TARAF BARBADI HAI,<br>
 SHABBIR KI BETI JO THI DULHAN LAASHE PA TADAP KE RONE LAGI<br>
<br>
ASGHAR NE LABON PAR SOOKHI ZUBAN DARYA KI TARAF HANSKAR PHERI,<br>
 DEKHI NA GAYI JAB TASHNA LABI HAR MOUJ TADAP KAR RONE LAGI<br>
<br>
AKBAR KA JIGAR DEKHA CHHALNI BEGOR-O-KAFAN LASHA THA WAHIN,<br>
 BAITHOONGI NA MAIN SAYE ME KABHI KAH KAH YE MADAR RONE LAGI<br>
<br>
AMMU MAIN ABHI TAK PYASI HOON KHAKAR MAIN TAMACHEY AAYI HOON,<br>
 LASHEY PA SAKINA KARKE BAYAN RUQSAAR BATKAR RONE LAGI<br>
<br>
SEENEY PA CHADHA JAB SHIMR-E-LAYEEN MAZLOOM PA KARNE ZULM-O-JAFA,<br>
 THA KHUSH HE PYASA SHEH KA GALA TALWAAR LARAZ KAR RONE LAGI<br>
<br>
KHAIMOUN ME SAARE AAG LAGI SAR SE BHI RIDAYEN CHHINI GAYI,<br>
 BEGOR-O-KAFAN BHAI HAI MERA ZAINAB YE KEHKAR RONE LAGI<br>
<br>
ABID KA GALA AUR TAUQ-E-GARAN BIMAAR LARAZTA THA US AAN,<br>
 ZAALIM JO PINHAANE AAGE BADHEY ZANJEER TADAP KAR RONE LAGI<br>
<br>
DASWEEN KO MOHARRAM KI QASIM MAQTAL MEIN AJAB THA HASHR BAPA,<br>
 AYE JO ALI TO ZAINAB YE RUDAAD SUNA KAR RONE LAGI